{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Forgotten Man\n\nAlways hidden behind a tree; hands out an Egg each chapter. Kris is the only one who knows him, and they keep forgetting each other over and over.","x":-180,"y":-70,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nThe only character who can find him — no one else ever sees him.","x":-130,"y":-538,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Egg**\nThe object he delivers each chapter — it has its own note and thematic submap.","x":346,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Is he Gaster?**\nThe Ch.1 room shares its design with Mystery Man's; he moves between both worlds.","x":164,"y":294,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Kris's repressed trauma?**\nThe only one present in his scenes; Ch.4 takes place during a child therapy session.","x":-424,"y":294,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Is he Papyrus?**\nActual Fangamer merchandise shows him behind a similar tree — no clue within the game itself.","x":-606,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/man_2nd_Sanctuary_window_overworld_egg_comparison.png","x":-126,"y":-933,"width":143,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/man_egg.png","x":717,"y":-358,"width":180,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster-follower-3.png","x":420,"y":582,"width":153,"height":180},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Man_screenshot_Chapter_4_debug.png","x":-665,"y":570,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/man_Bibliox_screenshot_hermit_mumble.png","x":-951,"y":-334,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Man_overworld_tree.gif","x":-711,"y":114,"width":210,"height":180},{"id":"s_valentin","type":"text","text":"**Valentine's Card (2024)** His first real appearance, more than a year before Ch.3 — it repeats almost word for word his closing line \"wash your face and get dressed\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote].","x":700,"y":-209,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_islaolvidada","type":"text","text":"**Forgotten Island / Flying Aces** His personal realm in Mancountry; the Rudinns are copies that Kris colored as a child — key to the Vessel theory.","x":0,"y":600,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"3"}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_valentin","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_valentin","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_islaolvidada","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_islaolvidada","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_gaster_trauma","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_papyrus_gaster","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_kris_trauma","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_valentin_huevo","fromNode":"s_valentin","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_isla_trauma","fromNode":"s_islaolvidada","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"}]}